error[E0119]: [CGP-E014] conflicting wiring: `MyNamespace` redirects `@foo.T` twice, to `@baz` and to `@qux`
  --> src/main.rs:22:10
   |
21 |         @foo.Bar => @baz,
   |          ------- first implementation here
22 |         @foo.<T> T => @qux,
   |          ^^^^^^^^^ conflicting implementation for `@foo.Bar`

For more information about this error, try `rustc --explain E0119`.
